@base = http://localhost:5000

### Config: ABC (Host)
GET {{base}}/api/firma/config
Host: abc.localhost

### Config: XYZ (X-Client)
GET {{base}}/api/firma/config
X-Client: XYZ

### Login: ABC (X-Client)
# @name loginAbc
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
X-Client: ABC
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kullaniciAdi": "admin", "sifre": "Abc123!" }

### Login: XYZ (Host)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Host: xyz.localhost
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kullaniciAdi": "admin", "sifre": "Xyz123!" }

### Ben
GET {{base}}/api/auth/ben
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAbc.response.body.$.token}}

### ABC token, XYZ domaini: 403
GET {{base}}/api/auth/ben
Host: xyz.localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAbc.response.body.$.token}}

### Login: XYZ admin (X-Client)
# @name loginXyz
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
X-Client: XYZ
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kullaniciAdi": "admin", "sifre": "Xyz123!" }

### Kullanıcı kaydı: ABC ayse (201)
POST {{base}}/api/kullanicilar
X-Client: ABC
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kullaniciAdi": "ayse", "sifre": "Ayse123!" }

### Kullanıcı kaydı: XYZ ayse (201, farklı firmada aynı ad)
POST {{base}}/api/kullanicilar
X-Client: XYZ
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kullaniciAdi": "ayse", "sifre": "Ayse456!" }

### Kullanıcı kaydı: ABC ayse tekrar (409)
POST {{base}}/api/kullanicilar
X-Client: ABC
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kullaniciAdi": "ayse", "sifre": "Ayse123!" }

### Login: ABC ayse
# @name loginAyse
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
X-Client: ABC
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kullaniciAdi": "ayse", "sifre": "Ayse123!" }

### Ürün ekle: ABC admin
# @name urunKalem
POST {{base}}/api/urunler
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAbc.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kod": "KLM-1", "ad": "Mavi Kalem", "fiyat": 12.5, "stok": 10 }

### Ürün ekle: ABC admin, pasif ürün
# @name urunSilgi
POST {{base}}/api/urunler
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAbc.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kod": "SLG-1", "ad": "Silgi", "fiyat": 5, "stok": 100, "aktifMi": false }

### Ürün ara: ABC
GET {{base}}/api/urunler?arama=Kalem
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAyse.response.body.$.token}}

### Ürün ara: XYZ (ABC'nin ürünleri görünmez)
GET {{base}}/api/urunler?arama=Kalem
Authorization: Bearer {{loginXyz.response.body.$.token}}

### Ürün ara: kelimenin bir kısmı ("ale" -> Kalem), cevapta toplamKayit, sureMs ve kaynak var
GET {{base}}/api/urunler?arama=ale
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAbc.response.body.$.token}}

### Deneme ürünü yükle: ABC'ye 10 bin (adet en fazla 1000000)
POST {{base}}/api/yonetim/urunler/seed?adet=10000
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAbc.response.body.$.token}}

### Sepete ekle: ayse, 3 kalem
POST {{base}}/api/sepet/urunler
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAyse.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "urunId": "{{urunKalem.response.body.$.id}}", "adet": 3 }

### Sepete ekle: stoktan fazla (400)
POST {{base}}/api/sepet/urunler
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAyse.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "urunId": "{{urunKalem.response.body.$.id}}", "adet": 50 }

### Sepete ekle: pasif ürün (400)
POST {{base}}/api/sepet/urunler
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAyse.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "urunId": "{{urunSilgi.response.body.$.id}}", "adet": 1 }

### Sepeti görüntüle
GET {{base}}/api/sepet
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAyse.response.body.$.token}}

### Sepetten çıkar
DELETE {{base}}/api/sepet/urunler/{{urunKalem.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAyse.response.body.$.token}}

### Sipariş oluştur (önce sepete ürün ekleyin)
POST {{base}}/api/siparisler
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAyse.response.body.$.token}}

### Siparişlerim
GET {{base}}/api/siparisler
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAyse.response.body.$.token}}

### Yönetim: ABC siparişleri
GET {{base}}/api/yonetim/siparisler
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAbc.response.body.$.token}}

### Yönetim: ABC kullanıcıları
GET {{base}}/api/yonetim/kullanicilar
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAbc.response.body.$.token}}

### Yönetim: yönetici olmayan kullanıcı (403)
GET {{base}}/api/yonetim/kullanicilar
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAyse.response.body.$.token}}
